{"title":"2004 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2004 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Lloyd is practising his arithmetic by taking the reciprocal of a number and by adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to a number.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>(add images to problem 1 page)\n</p><p>Taking the reciprocal of a number is denoted by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is denoted by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Here is an example of Lloyd’s work, starting with an input of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />:\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using an input of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, fill in the five blanks below:\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The reciprocal of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/6/8363ecc686113b1d0cce7b74ec234541e43302f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\frac{1}{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"24\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p><p>Adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to this, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/f/11fcfe8a04e2c52774403f37ba9df873b1c6927a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + \\frac{1}{3} = \\frac{3 \\times 1 + 1}{3} = \\boxed{\\frac{4}{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"195\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>The reciprocal of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/3/7b33bd495b7492f95385da7afb197cd34638cdfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/c/c6c0e15975254d3dc4e5615eb79749deb3b26f99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\frac{3}{4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"24\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p><p>Adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to this, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/8/dc8b49a1ce7d16d80c42ad2a41d3b5f8c21c72fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + \\frac{3}{4} = \\frac{4 \\times 1 + 3}{4} = \\boxed{\\frac{7}{4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"195\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p><p>The reciprocal of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/5/70564be23564e35c9b8e70aceebe110199950f79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{7}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/b/d0b0e038c6bd8d904556544e7cb46c52f2d3c6b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\frac{4}{7}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"26\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p><p>Filling in the blanks, we get:\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017094730\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.030 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 78/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2441/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2945/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   22.347      1 -total\n 90.67%   20.261      1 2004_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1\n 23.92%    5.345      4 Template:Image_needed\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36914:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017094730 and revision id 285723. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}